Round Robin: same resources present on all the servers then : its is homogeneous and round robin is suitable here
  * r1> first sever r2-> second server r3-> third server r4-> first server 
Weighted Round Robin: different resource servers present then 
  * weights : [5,1,1] : then first 5 requests will be served from the first sever then 6th with second then 7th with third server 
IPhashing : if we want from certain ip address the hits must go to one specific server 
  * after hashing the IP we will take hash%3 == this is the resultant server 
Least Response time : the server giving least response time will be given the current request to be served 
Least Connection : the server having least number of connections will server the current request 


 